{
  "name": "auth-pages",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Working sign-in page and sign-out button for the installed auth provider",
  "supportedArchitectures": ["atomic", "feature", "hybrid"],
  "supportedBackends": ["supabase", "firebase"],
  "dependencies": ["google-auth"],
  "npmDependencies": {},
  "npmDevDependencies": {},
  "environmentVariables": [],
  "files": {
    "atomic": [
      {
        "source": "templates/page.tsx",
        "target": "src/app/auth/signin/page.tsx"
      },
      {
        "source": "templates/sign-out-button.supabase.tsx",
        "target": "{{dir.domain}}/authentication/components/sign-out-button.tsx",
        "when": {
          "backend": ["supabase"]
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "templates/sign-out-button.firebase.tsx",
        "target": "{{dir.domain}}/authentication/components/sign-out-button.tsx",
        "when": {
          "backend": ["firebase"]
        }
      }
    ],
    "feature": [
      {
        "source": "templates/page.tsx",
        "target": "src/app/auth/signin/page.tsx"
      },
      {
        "source": "templates/sign-out-button.supabase.tsx",
        "target": "{{dir.domain}}/authentication/components/sign-out-button.tsx",
        "when": {
          "backend": ["supabase"]
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "templates/sign-out-button.firebase.tsx",
        "target": "{{dir.domain}}/authentication/components/sign-out-button.tsx",
        "when": {
          "backend": ["firebase"]
        }
      }
    ],
    "hybrid": [
      {
        "source": "templates/page.tsx",
        "target": "src/app/auth/signin/page.tsx"
      },
      {
        "source": "templates/sign-out-button.supabase.tsx",
        "target": "{{dir.domain}}/authentication/components/sign-out-button.tsx",
        "when": {
          "backend": ["supabase"]
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "templates/sign-out-button.firebase.tsx",
        "target": "{{dir.domain}}/authentication/components/sign-out-button.tsx",
        "when": {
          "backend": ["firebase"]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "instructions": [
    "Sign-in page uses the server-verified getCurrentUser() and renders the provider's GoogleSignIn button.",
    "Wire the exported SignOutButton from @/features/authentication/components (or @/lib/..., in atomic) into the app header or profile page."
  ]
}